 case attaquée ; la restriction concerne les cases de départ, de passage et d’arrivée du roi. Vérifiez-les toutes.","ar":"قد يمر الرخ بمربع مهدد؛ لكن الشرط يتعلق بمربعات بداية الملك وعبوره ووصوله. افحصها جميعاً قبل التبييت."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Castling through check","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le roque en passant par l’échec","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. التبييت عبر الكش"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q11', 'l1-10', 11, 'medium', 'true_false', '{"en":"True or false: A player cannot castle while in check or if the king crosses or lands on an attacked square.","fr":"Vrai ou faux : On ne peut pas roquer si le roi est en échec, traverse une case attaquée ou arrive sur une case attaquée.","ar":"صح أم خطأ: لا يجوز التبييت إذا كان الملك في كش أو عبر مربعاً مهدداً أو وصل إلى مربع مهدد."}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"true","label":{"en":"True","fr":"Vrai","ar":"صح"}},{"id":"false","label":{"en":"False","fr":"Faux","ar":"خطأ"}}]'::jsonb, 'true', '{"en":"The rook’s path may cross an attacked square; the restriction concerns the king’s starting, transit, and destination squares. Check all three before castling.","fr":"La tour peut traverser une case attaquée ; la restriction concerne les cases de départ, de passage et d’arrivée du roi. Vérifiez-les toutes.","ar":"قد يمر الرخ بمربع مهدد؛ لكن الشرط يتعلق بمربعات بداية الملك وعبوره ووصوله. افحصها جميعاً قبل التبييت."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Castling through check","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le roque en passant par l’échec","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. التبييت عبر الكش"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q12', 'l1-10', 12, 'hard', 'identify_mistake', '{"en":"A student claims: “Castling is legal through check as long as the king’s final square is safe.” Is the claim correct?","fr":"Un élève affirme : « Le roque est permis en traversant l’échec si la case finale du roi est sûre. » Cette affirmation est-elle correcte ?","ar":"يقول طالب: «يصح التبييت عبر الكش ما دام مربع الملك الأخير آمناً.» هل قوله صحيح؟"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"true","label":{"en":"True","fr":"Vrai","ar":"صح"}},{"id":"false","label":{"en":"False","fr":"Faux","ar":"خطأ"}}]'::jsonb, 'false', '{"en":"The rook’s path may cross an attacked square; the restriction concerns the king’s starting, transit, and destination squares. Check all three before castling.","fr":"La tour peut traverser une case attaquée ; la restriction concerne les cases de départ, de passage et d’arrivée du roi. Vérifiez-les toutes.","ar":"قد يمر الرخ بمربع مهدد؛ لكن الشرط يتعلق بمربعات بداية الملك وعبوره ووصوله. افحصها جميعاً قبل التبييت."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Castling through check","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le roque en passant par l’échec","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. التبييت عبر الكش"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q13', 'l1-10', 13, 'easy', 'multiple_choice', '{"en":"Which statement correctly describes En passant timing?","fr":"Quelle affirmation décrit correctement Le moment de la prise en passant ?","ar":"أي عبارة تصف توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز بشكل صحيح؟"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"a","label":{"en":"En passant is legal only on the move immediately after the opposing pawn advances two squares.","fr":"La prise en passant n’est légale qu’immédiatement après la double avance du pion adverse.","ar":"يصح الأخذ بالتجاوز فقط في النقلة التي تلي مباشرة تقدم بيدق الخصم مربعين."}},{"id":"b","label":{"en":"A promoting pawn may become a queen, rook, bishop, or knight, even if that piece is still on the board.","fr":"Un pion promu peut devenir dame, tour, fou ou cavalier, même si cette pièce est encore sur l’échiquier.","ar":"يمكن ترقية البيدق إلى ملكة أو رخ أو فيل أو حصان حتى لو كانت قطعة من النوع نفسه ما زالت على الرقعة."}},{"id":"c","label":{"en":"Castling moves the king two squares toward a rook and moves that rook to the square next to the king.","fr":"Le roque déplace le roi de deux cases vers une tour, puis place la tour à côté du roi.","ar":"ينقل التبييت الملك مربعين نحو الرخ، ثم يضع الرخ في المربع المجاور للملك."}},{"id":"d","label":{"en":"Neither the king nor the castling rook may have moved earlier in the game.","fr":"Ni le roi ni la tour concernée ne doivent avoir déjà bougé pendant la partie.","ar":"يجب ألا يكون الملك أو الرخ المستخدم قد تحرك سابقاً في المباراة."}}]'::jsonb, 'a', '{"en":"The right is temporary and disappears if another move is played. The capturing pawn moves diagonally to the passed-over square and removes the advanced pawn.","fr":"Ce droit est temporaire et disparaît si un autre coup est joué. Le pion preneur va sur la case traversée et retire le pion adverse.","ar":"هذا الحق مؤقت ويسقط إذا لُعبت نقلة أخرى. ينتقل البيدق الآسر إلى المربع المتجاوز ويزيل بيدق الخصم."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. En passant timing","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le moment de la prise en passant","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q14', 'l1-10', 14, 'medium', 'multiple_choice', '{"en":"You are teaching a beginner about En passant timing. Which rule should they apply?","fr":"Vous expliquez Le moment de la prise en passant à un débutant. Quelle règle doit-il appliquer ?","ar":"تشرح توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز لمبتدئ. ما القاعدة التي ينبغي تطبيقها؟"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"a","label":{"en":"Neither the king nor the castling rook may have moved earlier in the game.","fr":"Ni le roi ni la tour concernée ne doivent avoir déjà bougé pendant la partie.","ar":"يجب ألا يكون الملك أو الرخ المستخدم قد تحرك سابقاً في المباراة."}},{"id":"b","label":{"en":"En passant is legal only on the move immediately after the opposing pawn advances two squares.","fr":"La prise en passant n’est légale qu’immédiatement après la double avance du pion adverse.","ar":"يصح الأخذ بالتجاوز فقط في النقلة التي تلي مباشرة تقدم بيدق الخصم مربعين."}},{"id":"c","label":{"en":"A promoting pawn may become a queen, rook, bishop, or knight, even if that piece is still on the board.","fr":"Un pion promu peut devenir dame, tour, fou ou cavalier, même si cette pièce est encore sur l’échiquier.","ar":"يمكن ترقية البيدق إلى ملكة أو رخ أو فيل أو حصان حتى لو كانت قطعة من النوع نفسه ما زالت على الرقعة."}},{"id":"d","label":{"en":"Castling moves the king two squares toward a rook and moves that rook to the square next to the king.","fr":"Le roque déplace le roi de deux cases vers une tour, puis place la tour à côté du roi.","ar":"ينقل التبييت الملك مربعين نحو الرخ، ثم يضع الرخ في المربع المجاور للملك."}}]'::jsonb, 'b', '{"en":"The right is temporary and disappears if another move is played. The capturing pawn moves diagonally to the passed-over square and removes the advanced pawn.","fr":"Ce droit est temporaire et disparaît si un autre coup est joué. Le pion preneur va sur la case traversée et retire le pion adverse.","ar":"هذا الحق مؤقت ويسقط إذا لُعبت نقلة أخرى. ينتقل البيدق الآسر إلى المربع المتجاوز ويزيل بيدق الخصم."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. En passant timing","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le moment de la prise en passant","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q15', 'l1-10', 15, 'medium', 'true_false', '{"en":"True or false: En passant is legal only on the move immediately after the opposing pawn advances two squares.","fr":"Vrai ou faux : La prise en passant n’est légale qu’immédiatement après la double avance du pion adverse.","ar":"صح أم خطأ: يصح الأخذ بالتجاوز فقط في النقلة التي تلي مباشرة تقدم بيدق الخصم مربعين."}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"true","label":{"en":"True","fr":"Vrai","ar":"صح"}},{"id":"false","label":{"en":"False","fr":"Faux","ar":"خطأ"}}]'::jsonb, 'true', '{"en":"The right is temporary and disappears if another move is played. The capturing pawn moves diagonally to the passed-over square and removes the advanced pawn.","fr":"Ce droit est temporaire et disparaît si un autre coup est joué. Le pion preneur va sur la case traversée et retire le pion adverse.","ar":"هذا الحق مؤقت ويسقط إذا لُعبت نقلة أخرى. ينتقل البيدق الآسر إلى المربع المتجاوز ويزيل بيدق الخصم."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. En passant timing","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le moment de la prise en passant","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q16', 'l1-10', 16, 'hard', 'identify_mistake', '{"en":"A student claims: “En passant remains legal for the rest of the game after the two-square pawn move.” Is the claim correct?","fr":"Un élève affirme : « La prise en passant reste possible jusqu’à la fin de la partie après la double avance. » Cette affirmation est-elle correcte ?","ar":"يقول طالب: «يبقى الأخذ بالتجاوز قانونياً حتى نهاية المباراة بعد حركة البيدق المزدوجة.» هل قوله صحيح؟"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"true","label":{"en":"True","fr":"Vrai","ar":"صح"}},{"id":"false","label":{"en":"False","fr":"Faux","ar":"خطأ"}}]'::jsonb, 'false', '{"en":"The right is temporary and disappears if another move is played. The capturing pawn moves diagonally to the passed-over square and removes the advanced pawn.","fr":"Ce droit est temporaire et disparaît si un autre coup est joué. Le pion preneur va sur la case traversée et retire le pion adverse.","ar":"هذا الحق مؤقت ويسقط إذا لُعبت نقلة أخرى. ينتقل البيدق الآسر إلى المربع المتجاوز ويزيل بيدق الخصم."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. En passant timing","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le moment de la prise en passant","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. توقيت الأخذ بالتجاوز"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q17', 'l1-10', 17, 'easy', 'multiple_choice', '{"en":"Which statement correctly describes Promotion choice?","fr":"Quelle affirmation décrit correctement Le choix de promotion ?","ar":"أي عبارة تصف اختيار الترقية بشكل صحيح؟"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"a","label":{"en":"A player cannot castle while in check or if the king crosses or lands on an attacked square.","fr":"On ne peut pas roquer si le roi est en échec, traverse une case attaquée ou arrive sur une case attaquée.","ar":"لا يجوز التبييت إذا كان الملك في كش أو عبر مربعاً مهدداً أو وصل إلى مربع مهدد."}},{"id":"b","label":{"en":"A promoting pawn may become a queen, rook, bishop, or knight, even if that piece is still on the board.","fr":"Un pion promu peut devenir dame, tour, fou ou cavalier, même si cette pièce est encore sur l’échiquier.","ar":"يمكن ترقية البيدق إلى ملكة أو رخ أو فيل أو حصان حتى لو كانت قطعة من النوع نفسه ما زالت على الرقعة."}},{"id":"c","label":{"en":"Castling moves the king two squares toward a rook and moves that rook to the square next to the king.","fr":"Le roque déplace le roi de deux cases vers une tour, puis place la tour à côté du roi.","ar":"ينقل التبييت الملك مربعين نحو الرخ، ثم يضع الرخ في المربع المجاور للملك."}},{"id":"d","label":{"en":"Neither the king nor the castling rook may have moved earlier in the game.","fr":"Ni le roi ni la tour concernée ne doivent avoir déjà bougé pendant la partie.","ar":"يجب ألا يكون الملك أو الرخ المستخدم قد تحرك سابقاً في المباراة."}}]'::jsonb, 'b', '{"en":"Promotion is not limited by captured pieces. A knight promotion may be useful to give a check or avoid stalemate; choose the piece that best fits the position.","fr":"La promotion ne dépend pas des pièces capturées. Un cavalier peut être utile pour donner échec ou éviter le pat ; choisissez selon la position.","ar":"لا تعتمد الترقية على القطع المأسورة. قد يفيد الحصان لإعطاء كش أو تجنب الجمود؛ اختر القطعة الأنسب للموقف."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Promotion choice","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le choix de promotion","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. اختيار الترقية"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
