nner échec ou éviter le pat ; choisissez selon la position.","ar":"لا تعتمد الترقية على القطع المأسورة. قد يفيد الحصان لإعطاء كش أو تجنب الجمود؛ اختر القطعة الأنسب للموقف."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Promotion choice","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le choix de promotion","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. اختيار الترقية"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q19', 'l1-10', 19, 'medium', 'true_false', '{"en":"True or false: A promoting pawn may become a queen, rook, bishop, or knight, even if that piece is still on the board.","fr":"Vrai ou faux : Un pion promu peut devenir dame, tour, fou ou cavalier, même si cette pièce est encore sur l’échiquier.","ar":"صح أم خطأ: يمكن ترقية البيدق إلى ملكة أو رخ أو فيل أو حصان حتى لو كانت قطعة من النوع نفسه ما زالت على الرقعة."}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"true","label":{"en":"True","fr":"Vrai","ar":"صح"}},{"id":"false","label":{"en":"False","fr":"Faux","ar":"خطأ"}}]'::jsonb, 'true', '{"en":"Promotion is not limited by captured pieces. A knight promotion may be useful to give a check or avoid stalemate; choose the piece that best fits the position.","fr":"La promotion ne dépend pas des pièces capturées. Un cavalier peut être utile pour donner échec ou éviter le pat ; choisissez selon la position.","ar":"لا تعتمد الترقية على القطع المأسورة. قد يفيد الحصان لإعطاء كش أو تجنب الجمود؛ اختر القطعة الأنسب للموقف."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Promotion choice","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le choix de promotion","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. اختيار الترقية"}'::jsonb, NULL, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
INSERT INTO public.academy_questions (id, lesson_id, question_number, difficulty, question_type, prompt, choices, correct_answer, explanation, hint, fen, solution_moves) VALUES ('l1-10-q20', 'l1-10', 20, 'hard', 'best_move', '{"en":"On the board, make a legal move that demonstrates Promotion choice.","fr":"Sur l’échiquier, jouez un coup légal qui illustre Le choix de promotion.","ar":"نفّذ على الرقعة نقلة قانونية توضح اختيار الترقية."}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"Ra4","label":{"en":"Ra4","fr":"Ra4","ar":"Ra4"}},{"id":"O-O","label":{"en":"O-O","fr":"O-O","ar":"O-O"}},{"id":"Ra2","label":{"en":"Ra2","fr":"Ra2","ar":"Ra2"}},{"id":"Ra3","label":{"en":"Ra3","fr":"Ra3","ar":"Ra3"}}]'::jsonb, 'O-O', '{"en":"O-O is legal here: the king and rook have not moved, the path is clear, and the king does not cross an attacked square.","fr":"O-O est légal ici : le roi et la tour n’ont pas bougé, le chemin est libre et le roi ne traverse aucune case attaquée.","ar":"O-O قانونية هنا: لم يتحرك الملك أو الرخ، والطريق خالٍ، ولا يعبر الملك مربعاً مهدداً."}'::jsonb, '{"en":"Review the rule and compare it with the position. Promotion choice","fr":"Relisez la règle et comparez-la à la position. Le choix de promotion","ar":"راجع القاعدة وقارنها بالوضع على الرقعة. اختيار الترقية"}'::jsonb, 'r3k2r/8/8/8/8/8/8/R3K2R w KQkq - 0 1', '["O-O"]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET lesson_id = EXCLUDED.lesson_id, question_number = EXCLUDED.question_number, difficulty = EXCLUDED.difficulty, question_type = EXCLUDED.question_type, prompt = EXCLUDED.prompt, choices = EXCLUDED.choices, correct_answer = EXCLUDED.correct_answer, explanation = EXCLUDED.explanation, hint = EXCLUDED.hint, fen = EXCLUDED.fen, solution_moves = EXCLUDED.solution_moves;
